# AI-governance issue drafts are local work-in-progress; never commit ad-hoc
# tool output. Curated release artifacts of THIS repository (pr-*.md / issue-*.md)
# and the staging-area README stay tracked; a draft meant for another repository
# (upstream-*.md, e.g. an engine issue for zipnative) stays local until a human
# files it there.
.github/drafts/*
!.github/drafts/README.md
!.github/drafts/TEMPLATE.md
!.github/drafts/pr-*.md
!.github/drafts/issue-*.md

